    v6.47.0: compaction shown on the Map, auto-compact no longer defeats auto handoff
    
    - Transcript compact_boundary lines are parsed; continuation cards on the Map
      say whether Claude Code auto-compacted or /compact was used, with the
      context change (968K -> 36K).
    - A PreCompact hook (matcher "auto") blocks auto-compaction once in a large
      session that auto handoff is still waiting on; when the reply ends the work
      moves to a new session even below the threshold. /compact, idle compaction,
      the second attempt and the app-not-running case are never blocked.
    
