    v6.42.0: Office page — projects as rooms, agents as robots in 3D
    
    - New «Ofis» section (⌘6): a SceneKit building with up to 6 project rooms;
      empty slots become small gardens.
    - Every robot pose comes from real state: working at the desk (tool icon on
      the monitor), thinking («…»), waiting for permission (stands and waves,
      yellow room outline), error (turns away, sad eyes), idle (coffee on the
      sofa), sleeping («z z»). Face-screen eyes change with state and blink.
    - Robots walk to their own desk or sofa seat when state changes; idle ones
      sometimes wander to the shelf, window or plant. Extra robots sit at free
      desks or on the floor.
