      card when the helper starts; the helper hops and sends a «✓ Done» card back.
    - A watcher drone patrols and shines a beam on robots needing attention;
      clicking it lists those rooms.
    - Click a robot to open its session map; room chips focus the camera,
      «Butun ofis» resets it. Drag to orbit, pinch or wheel to zoom.
    - Sky and room lights follow the clock; still in Reduce Motion / light mode;
      rendering pauses when the window is hidden.
    
