Date:   Thu Oct 29 17:09:02 2026 +0500

    v6.32.1: stop UI language flicker from handoff summaries
    
    GitState waited with waitUntilExit(), which spins the run loop, so on the
    main thread SwiftUI redrew inside Lang.with and showed the conversation
    language (e.g. Jonli · 2 agent). Wait on a semaphore instead, keep the
    language override thread-local, and register By cost as the default count mode.
    
